<div class="mpgdetail">
	
		
 		
		
		
		
		
	
	
   <div class="meditor"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-size: 15px;"><span class="_5mfr" style="margin: 0px 1px;"><span class="_6qdm" style="background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: contain; color: transparent; display: inline-block; text-shadow: none; vertical-align: text-bottom; font-family: inherit; height: 16px; width: 16px; font-size: 16px; background-image: url(&quot;https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t13/1.5/16/1f4e3.png?_nc_eui2=AeHL29_cUOcxsXPXTQsb1kGnQvRzjYCQ2C8kwlxVWkwkHlVp14kQy7r41z_mc4HBSu24AvTe5gzLiA7-PaIs3ncEmXM3AyM9L3OZrUaT4_FHuQ&quot;);">📣</span></span>EMRD碩士在職專班，109招生開跑囉<span class="_5mfr" style="margin: 0px 1px;"><span class="_6qdm" style="background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: contain; color: transparent; display: inline-block; text-shadow: none; vertical-align: text-bottom; font-family: inherit; height: 16px; width: 16px; font-size: 16px; background-image: url(&quot;https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t13/1.5/16/1f4e3.png?_nc_eui2=AeHL29_cUOcxsXPXTQsb1kGnQvRzjYCQ2C8kwlxVWkwkHlVp14kQy7r41z_mc4HBSu24AvTe5gzLiA7-PaIs3ncEmXM3AyM9L3OZrUaT4_FHuQ&quot;);">📣</span></span><br />
